# Line 3 had three quote marks, so one phrase was left unclosed and the wake
# phrase was unquoted: Bana 'ayağa kalk' {wake_word}, uyan ' de.
# It is repaired to the pattern lines 1 and 2 already use, '{wake_word}, uyan',
# with a comma between the two quoted phrases. Every word of the original line
# is kept, including 'ayağa kalk'.
# Unvouched: tr-TR has no reviewer of record. Two questions are for a Turkish
# speaker and are not decided here: whether 'ayağa kalk' belongs in this line
# at all, and whether the two phrases are one phrase, 'ayağa kalk {wake_word},
# uyan', rather than two.
Tamam, uyuyacağım. '{wake_word}, uyan' diyerek beni uyandırabilirsiniz.
Uyuyacağım. Yine dikkatimi çekmek için '{wake_word}, uyan' de.
Şimdi uyuyacağım. Bana 'ayağa kalk', '{wake_word}, uyan' de.